---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { COMPANY, CONTACT, isSet } from '../config';
---

<Base title="Privacy — Shab" description="How Shab handles personal data.">
  <article class="section container prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="prose__note">
      A starting point, not legal advice. Have it reviewed before you rely on it, and replace
      every bracketed value below.
    </p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      {COMPANY.name}, ABN
      <span class:list={[!isSet(COMPANY.abn) && 'placeholder']}>{COMPANY.abn}</span>,
      <span class:list={[!isSet(COMPANY.address) && 'placeholder']}>{COMPANY.address}</span>.
      We handle personal information under the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) and the Australian
      Privacy Principles.
    </p>

    <h2>What this site collects</h2>
    <p>
      This site sets no cookies and runs no third-party trackers. Fonts are served from this
      domain rather than a third party, so visiting a page sends nothing to anyone else. If
      analytics are enabled they are aggregate only and identify no individual visitor.
    </p>

    <h2>Booking a call</h2>
    <p>
      The booking button opens a scheduling page hosted by a third party. Anything you enter
      there is handled under that provider's privacy policy as well as ours.
    </p>

    <h2>When you contact us</h2>
    <p>
      If you email us we keep the message and your contact details so we can respond and, where
      relevant, carry out work for you. We do not sell personal information or disclose it
      overseas except through the service providers described above.
    </p>

    <h2>Access, correction and complaints</h2>
    <p>
      You may ask what personal information we hold about you and ask us to correct it. Write to
      <span class:list={[!isSet(CONTACT.email) && 'placeholder']}>{CONTACT.email}</span>.
      If you are not satisfied with how we handle a privacy matter you can refer it to the
      Office of the Australian Information Commissioner at oaic.gov.au.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .prose h1 {
    font-size: var(--step-h2);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .prose h2 {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .prose p {
    font-size: var(--step-body);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .prose__note {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-soft);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
</style>
